@voice jovanovic-petra
// Works writer. Petra Jovanovic (she/her): engine technician, junior, night shift, Bunk 8. Nervous, reliable. Common
// room, calls home, lounge and bar regular (sociable, and anxious about it). "Tends the coils on the long engine
// watch." Married just before the tour and counts the days (to someone back home). Grew up on Valo; misses the rain.
//
// HOW SHE TALKS: quiet and careful; qualifies everything ("I think", "maybe", "probably"); and is always right about
// the coils.
// WITH JUNIORS: double-checks your work, then apologises for double-checking. Very reliable.
// WHAT SHE NOTICES: the coils' readings; whether she's said too much; rain on Valo in the letters.
// MOOD TELLS: low = calls home twice; high = laughs at Reyes's cat stories at handover.
// NEVER: claims to be sure (she always is); talks about the night the coils nearly went (until friend tier).
// RUNNING: "I think" before every answer, and always right; trading coil worries with Reyes at handover; the day
// count, compared with Silva, Soto and Dlamini.
